        {
          "audio": "Copy it and give it to Codex, it will help you install and connect it, so it's done.",
          "label": "Opening Hook",
          "visual": "A clean, white digital workspace background. A chat bubble appears at the top containing a command prompt. Below, two rounded black buttons slide into frame horizontally from the center. The layout is minimalist with high contrast. Lighting is flat and even across the digital interface. The color palette is strictly monochrome with white, gray, and black.",
